	JMP I SVFILE		/ USER QUITS
	JMS SETFN		/ SET ACTIVE FILE

SVFLA,	JMS WRITEF		/ WRITE THE FILE
	JMP I SVFILE

	DCA CHANGD		/ BUFFER NOT CHANGED

