/ SEARCH AGAIN FOR LAST SEARCH STRING
SCHNXT,	0
	TAD SSTRNG		/ ANY STRING?
	SPA CLA
	JMP I SCHNXT

	JMS SFWDPT		/ YES, START AT POINT
	TAD [SRCHP		/ AT END OF BUFFER?
