BWORD,	0
	JMS SREVGP

/ SKIP NON-ALPHANUMERIC
BWORDA,	TAD [SRCHP		/ AT BEGINNING OF BUFFER?
	JMS SNE15; BUF
	JMP I BWORD
	TAD [SRCHP		/ NO, BACK UP
	JMS DEC15
	TAD [SRCHP		/ GET CHAR		
