	JMP BWORDA

/ SKIP OVER ALPHANUMERIC
BWORDB,	TAD [SRCHP		/ BACK ONE
	JMS DEC15
	TAD [SRCHP		/ AT BEGINNING OF BUFFER?
	JMS SNE15; BUF
	JMP BWORDC
	TAD [SRCHP		/ NO, GET CHAR
	JMS GET15
	JMS SKIPAN		/ ALPHANUMERIC?
	SKP
	JMP BWORDB

	TAD [SRCHP		/ NO, BACK TO A-N CHAR
